data: {"id": "78bd70a60f994e59-thinking-parallel_evidence-542", "run_id": "78bd70a60f994e59", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "从预采集结果中，**Logging 已出现关键决断性证据**：容器主进程尝试读取 `/input/app.conf`，抛出 `FileNotFoundError`，这直接解释了 CrashLoopBackOff 的原因（进程启动即失败并退出）。Metrics 确认了 `CrashLoopBackOff` + `last_terminated_reason=Error` + 7 次重启，与日志时间窗一致。Tracing 为空符合\"进程启动失败、来不及建立 L7 流量\"的预期。\n\n接下来执行计划中的 Kubernetes 层验证（describe、yaml、previous logs、events）以确认 Exit Code/Reason、探针配置和控制器关系。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789136732800, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

