event: thinking
data: {"id": "78bd70a60f994e59-thinking-parallel_evidence-850", "run_id": "78bd70a60f994e59", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到关键决断性证据，足以验证\"容器启动失败\"的直接原因。\n\n### 已支持的事实（根因确认）\n- **异常状态**：Pod `workload` (`uid: 5746c496-...`) 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`，`containerStatuses` 显示 `restarts=7`，`Exit Code=1`。\n- **直接原因**：容器主进程在启动时尝试读取 `/input/app.conf`，日志明确抛出 `FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/input/app.conf'`。\n- **事件印证**：Events 显示 `Warning BackOff`，表明 kubelet 在检测到容器频繁崩溃退出后进入了指数退避的重启等待阶段。\n- **环境约束**：日志中的 `command` 为 `python3 -u -c ... read_text('/input/app.conf')`。由于 Pod 的 `volumes` 中 `input` 挂载类型为 `EmptyDir`（即", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789136738509, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "78bd70a60f994e59-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "78bd70a60f994e59", "seq": 851, "ts_ms": 1789136744667, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 40.444, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v09", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/78bd70a60f994e59-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "8a0b3e29d9080f10ec6e9f9d231906a9de38812aa39ce1d9c0effe37a4fc6e7b", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "fb4b8aa3eefb7c83833d6a48678cd97f61aaa5e36532561089e757fc720314da"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

