而异常退出（exit code 1），进而触发 Kubernetes 的 CrashLoopBackOff 机制。\n- **支持证据**：\n  - 终止状态与退出码：`fact-232d530e3cd5` (Reason: Error), `fact-1028ea202e98` (exit code 1)。\n  - 应用错误堆栈：`fact-bd3424bfb9ca` (读取 /input/app.conf 的 Traceback), `fact-0d0fa82a82e1` (FileNotFoundError)。\n  - 资源状态：`fact-b911581b9a5d` (CrashLoopBackOff), `fact-217c782d62bf` (BackOff Event)。\n- **排除因素**：CPU (50m) 和 Memory (32Mi) 资源限制充足 (`fact-2ce6981b4d48`, `fact-d38624094aea`)，无 OOM 终止记录。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 40.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v09/workload: 40.4s (Evidence 34.4s, RCA 5.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v09/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 69.397, "metrics": {"run_id": "78bd70a60f994e59", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 69.40295147895813, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "de